   "description": "The People’s Republic of China Ministry of Agriculture (MOA) Vice Minister H.E. Zhang Taolin, center right, leader of the Chinese Agricultural Delegation and the U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA) Under Secretary for Natural Resources and Environment (NRE) Robert Bonnie, center left, and other USDA leaders at the USDA headquarters Whitten Building, in Washington, D.C., on Friday June 13, 2014. Pictured here from left to right, are USDA Natural Resources Conservation Service (NRCS) Science and Technology Deputy Chief C. Wayne Honeycutt, Ph.D., Office of the Chief Economist (OCE) Climate Change Program Director William Hohenstein, Forest Service (USFS) and International Programs Asia Program Specialist Darcy Nelson, NRCS Farm Bill Programs Assistant State Conservationist Gerald L. Roach, Foreign Agricultural Service (FAS) Office of Country And Regional Affairs (OCRA) China and Hong Kong Desk Officer Lauren McGraw, FAS Associate Administrator Suzanne Palmieri, Natural Resources and Environment (NRE) Deputy Under Secretary Butch Blazer, Under Secretary Robert Bonnie, The People’s Republic of China Ministry of Agriculture (MOA) Vice Minister H.E. Zhang Taolin, MOA Department of Finance Director-General Li Jianhua, Department of International Cooperation Deputy Director-General Xie Jianmin and Wei Zhenglin, General Office Section Chief Jiang Yekui, Department of International Cooperation Program Officer Jin Taicheng, and Center of International Cooperation Service Interpreter Wan Ye. USDA Photo by Lance Cheung.",
